AB  - Talc slurry and poudrage are effective pleurodesis agents. IPCs have lower 
      pleurodesis rates but comparable breathlessness control and reduced risk of 
      repeat invasive procedures. It is essential that patients have access to a range 
      of treatment strategies. https://bit.ly/38v30yw
